  "body": " Affine space with invertible coordinates  Let be a basis of , and let for . In the dual basis, so At this is affine space; at it is the torus itself. The zero cone is therefore an essential chart, not an empty geometric object.  For the ray in a rank-two lattice, the chart is . The exponent is unrestricted in sign, so its character remains invertible everywhere. The dimension of the chart is two even though the cone has dimension one.  "
