  "body": " Keeping the negative section in the calculation  Use the convention of . The fan of , for , has cyclic rays with consecutive pairs as maximal cones. Write and , so . For choose . Its polyhedron is The Cartier points for cones are, in order, They all lie in exactly when and . These are therefore precisely the nef and globally generated classes. The strict inequalities give and as the ample condition.  The wall degrees on the fibers are , and the degree on the section is . For instance the wall has neighboring data and ; their difference is , with the orientation in . Thus the support inequalities and curve degrees give the same test without assuming an intersection table.  For a nef divisor count the slices : The class is globally generated. If , its polygon is the triangle with vertices ; its section map contracts , where the degree is zero. The divisor itself is effective but not nef for . At the formulas recover the rectangle on .  "
