  "body": "A toric realization of the matroid ring The fan is smooth in . Its associated toric variety has dimension , and its integral Chow ring is where is generated by for incomparable flats, and Thus .  A chain partitions into the nonempty blocks . In each block, its sum of coordinate vectors, together with all but one of those coordinate vectors, is an integral basis of its coordinate lattice. Replace the block sums successively by ; the change is triangular with determinant one. Modulo the chain vectors therefore form part of a basis of . The chain cones form a subfan of the fan of all chains of proper subsets, the braid fan, so this also realizes them as a fan.  Apply . A collection of flats lies in a cone exactly when it is a chain, so the minimal nonfaces are incomparable pairs. The dual lattice is , generated by coordinate differences. Their pairings with give exactly the displayed linear relations.  "
